        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(node (ref \"D35\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"K\") (pintype \"passive\"))\n      (node (ref \"R85\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\"))"},
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(node (ref \"Module2\") (pin \"17\") (pinfunction \"Ethernet_nLED2(3.3v)\") (pintype \"output\"))"}
      ],
      "impact": "The Ethernet and activity indicator LEDs cannot conduct and will stay dark, so the board gives no link or activity indication. The logic-level signals are unaffected.",
      "confidence": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The anode net of three status LEDs (D10, D35, D49) is isolated on /NET0148 with no supply connection, which looks like a missing tie to +3V3. The rest of the netlist and SPICE deck are consistent with the stated design, so this is the only deviation I could support with evidence."
